          H3("ART Sync: Coach Sync and PO Sync"),
          "ART Sync combines two conversations. The **Coach Sync** (formerly Scrum of Scrums) brings the RTE and Scrum Masters/Team Coaches together on progress, dependencies and impediments. The **PO Sync** brings Product Management and Product Owners together on scope and priorities. Small trains often hold one combined meeting; larger trains often run them on different days. Our [Scrum of Scrums guide](/project-management/scrum/scrum-of-scrums/) covers the facilitation technique.",
